@SWP301BETASK_HostAddress = https://localhost:7202

### GET all accounts
GET {{SWP301BETASK_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Accept: application/json

###

### CREATE account
POST {{SWP301BETASK_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
